  "description": {
    "raw": "You commune with the divine, reflecting on one type of creature you encountered in the last day. You may make a Knowledge check regarding that creature type with a +10 insight bonus.Mythic Know the EnemySource Mythic Adventures pg. 99\nThe insight bonus increases to +15 plus your tier. If the check is successful, you gain a +5 insight bonus on your next attack roll or saving throw against a creature of that type, as long as the roll occurs within 24 hours of casting the spell.",
    "search_text": "\"you commune with the divine, reflecting on one type of creature you encountered in the last day. you may make a knowledge check regarding that creature type with a +10 insight bonus.mythic know the enemysource mythic adventures pg. 99\\nthe insight bonus increases to +15 plus your tier. if the check is successful, you gain a +5 insight bonus on your next attack roll or saving throw against a creature of that type, as long as the roll occurs within 24 hours of casting the spell.\"",
